  "project_description": "This module uses the Config Pages module to override other configuration with the config pages field values. This eliminates the need to manually create an override service for each config page.\n\n Take for example you want a config pages to allow a user to change the site name. You can create a text field on a config page, and then use the value of that field to override the `system.site` configuration for the `name`.",
